0 -18 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(Document similarity in TF-IDF space is computed using the cosine of the angle) Tj
0 -14 Td
(between two sparse vectors: Cosine\(A, B\) = \(A . B\) / \(||A|| * ||B||\). When) Tj
0 -14 Td
(normalized, this yields a score between 0.0 and 1.0.) Tj
0 -14 Td
0 -8 Td
