0 -18 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(Recurrent Neural Networks \(RNNs\) process sequences token-by-token while) Tj
0 -14 Td
(maintaining an internal hidden state vector h_t that acts as a working memory of) Tj
0 -14 Td
(past context: h_t = tanh\(W_hh * h_{t-1} + W_xh * x_t + b_h\).) Tj
0 -14 Td
0 -8 Td
/F1 10 Tf
