/F1 16 Tf
(9. The Transformer Architecture) Tj
0 -24 Td
/F1 12 Tf
(9.1 Discarding Recurrence for Parallelism) Tj
0 -18 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(Introduced in the seminal paper 'Attention Is All You Need' \(Vaswani et al.,) Tj
0 -14 Td
(2017\), the Transformer architecture completely dispenses with recurrence and) Tj
0 -14 Td
(convolutions. By relying entirely on self-attention mechanisms, Transformers) Tj
0 -14 Td
(process all sequence tokens simultaneously in parallel, dramatically accelerating) Tj
0 -14 Td
(training on modern GPU hardware.) Tj
0 -14 Td
0 -8 Td
/F1 12 Tf
(9.2 Multi-Head Attention) Tj
0 -18 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(Instead of performing a single attention function, Multi-Head Attention linearly) Tj
0 -14 Td
(projects Queries, Keys, and Values h times with different learned parameter) Tj
0 -14 Td
(matrices:) Tj
0 -14 Td
0 -8 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(-  MultiHead\(Q, K, V\) = Concat\(head_1, ..., head_h\) * W_O) Tj
0 -14 Td
0 -4 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(-  Where head_i = Attention\(Q * W_i^Q, K * W_i^K, V * W_i^V\)) Tj
0 -14 Td
0 -4 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(Multi-head attention allows the model to jointly attend to information from) Tj
0 -14 Td
(different representation subspaces at different positions. One head can track) Tj
0 -14 Td
(grammatical subject-verb agreement, while another tracks coreference resolution) Tj
0 -14 Td
(across clauses.) Tj
0 -14 Td
0 -8 Td
/F1 12 Tf
(9.3 Positional Encoding) Tj
0 -18 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(Because the self-attention mechanism contains no recurrence, it is permutation-) Tj
0 -14 Td
(invariant: shuffling words produces identical self-attention scores. To inject) Tj
0 -14 Td
(token order, Transformers add Positional Encodings to input embeddings using) Tj
0 -14 Td
(sinusoidal functions of varying frequencies:) Tj
0 -14 Td
0 -8 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(-  PE\(pos, 2i\) = sin\( pos / \(10000^\(2i / d_model\)\) \)) Tj
0 -14 Td
0 -4 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(-  PE\(pos, 2i+1\) = cos\( pos / \(10000^\(2i / d_model\)\) \)) Tj
0 -14 Td
0 -4 Td
/F1 12 Tf
(9.4 Layer Normalization and Residual Connections) Tj
0 -18 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(Each sub-layer in the Transformer encoder and decoder incorporates a Residual) Tj
0 -14 Td
