0 -14 Td
(   semantic sentence embeddings.) Tj
0 -14 Td
0 -4 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(-  Decoder-Only \(GPT series, LLaMA\): Uses causal autoregressive masking where) Tj
0 -14 Td
(   tokens attend only to preceding positions. Ideal for open-ended text generation) Tj
0 -14 Td
(   and conversational reasoning.) Tj
0 -14 Td
0 -4 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(-  Encoder-Decoder \(T5, BART\): Combines bidirectional encoding with) Tj
0 -14 Td
(   autoregressive decoding. Ideal for machine translation and abstractive text) Tj
0 -14 Td
(   summarization.) Tj
0 -14 Td
0 -4 Td
/F1 12 Tf
