0 -14 Td
(embeddings. Models like all-MiniLM-L6-v2 map sentences into 384-dimensional dense) Tj
0 -14 Td
(vectors where cosine similarity directly measures semantic relatedness, forming) Tj
0 -14 Td
(the bedrock of modern Retrieval-Augmented Generation \(RAG\).) Tj
